ployee of $10.9M ranks in the top quartile among Real Estate peers, with revenue growing 10%/yr across its filed history. Stock-based compensation of $167K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 0\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["NNN REIT, Inc. is a mid-cap real estate business with a $8.2B market cap on $926M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +6% over the past three years and +7% annually across the full decade, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 10% against a 7% cost of capital, which means the business barely earns its keep economically.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.2\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and thin 2.9\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield of 4.4% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and within its sector the business captures 3.2\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Payout ratio looks stretched \u2014 the dividend\u2019s own margin of safety is thin","sev":"red","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 5.6% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Interest-rate sensitivity and tenant-credit risk \u2014 cap rates and refinancing costs move faster than the 10-year leases can absorb.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Remote work structural vacancy \u2014 the post-pandemic shift to hybrid work has permanently impaired demand for urban office space across most markets.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Climate and insurance cost escalation \u2014 rising premiums and coverage withdrawals in flood/fire zones are repricing assets that the market once treated as perpetuities.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 41% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Returns on capital have been remarkably steady for 5 years \u2014 durability is the real test of a moat","35 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Real Estate sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 6% over 3 months"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Understanding Momentum Shifts in (NNN)","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/22/Understanding_Momentum_Shifts_in_NNN_112626092401_1795703041.html","date":"2026-11-26","timestamp":1795703041.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"NNN REIT, Inc. (NYSE:NNN) Stock Has Consensus Target Price of $46.56","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/17/nnn-reit-inc-nysennn-stock-has-consensus-target-price-of-46-56.html","date":"2026-11-17","timestamp":1794914265.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.511,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Technical Reactions to NNN Trends in Macro Strategies","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/35/Technical_Reactions_to_NNN_Trends_in_Macro_Strategies_111626113001_1794846601.html","date":"2026-11-16","timestamp":1794846601.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"A 66-Year-Old Turned Down a $680,000 Annuity for a Portfolio Paying $3,669 a Month. Here\u2019s What She Gave Up","source":"247wallst.com","link":"http